{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00165",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 6.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.86,
      "end_seconds": 13.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.04,
      "end_seconds": 17.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.48,
      "end_seconds": 20.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.0,
      "end_seconds": 28.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "It's a very sore throat, mostly. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.91,
      "end_seconds": 30.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.8,
      "end_seconds": 37.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "It's been about a week now. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.81,
      "end_seconds": 41.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.82,
      "end_seconds": 45.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.09,
      "end_seconds": 48.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.71,
      "end_seconds": 57.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "A hoarse voice goes along with it, most of the time. The hoarse voice? That's been since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.55,
      "end_seconds": 61.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Okay. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.95,
      "end_seconds": 75.5,
      "duration_seconds": 13.55,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.8,
      "end_seconds": 79.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "So, have you had any drooling or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.97,
      "end_seconds": 83.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I haven't had drooling or cough, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.41,
      "end_seconds": 89.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any rash, runny nose or difficulty breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.4,
      "end_seconds": 91.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.43,
      "end_seconds": 94.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.88,
      "end_seconds": 102.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.54,
      "end_seconds": 106.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.32,
      "end_seconds": 112.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.67,
      "end_seconds": 117.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.17,
      "end_seconds": 120.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.65,
      "end_seconds": 122.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.6,
      "end_seconds": 135.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "Yes, I had cataract surgery on my right eye, last year. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.65,
      "end_seconds": 150.5,
      "duration_seconds": 13.85,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.26,
      "end_seconds": 154.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.85,
      "end_seconds": 158.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.73,
      "end_seconds": 165.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "I'm on Asthalin inhaler, when needed. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.98,
      "end_seconds": 169.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.23,
      "end_seconds": 171.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.6,
      "end_seconds": 191.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.43,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. So, do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.37,
      "end_seconds": 198.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "I've had asthma, yes. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.18,
      "end_seconds": 202.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.62,
      "end_seconds": 204.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.98,
      "end_seconds": 222.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.33,
      "end_seconds": 234.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.63,
      "end_seconds": 251.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 121 over 67, pulse is 104 beats a minute, saturation 96 percent, temperature 38.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.78,
      "end_seconds": 253.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.82,
      "end_seconds": 256.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.19,
      "end_seconds": 259.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.31,
      "end_seconds": 261.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.17,
      "end_seconds": 275.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.97,
      "end_seconds": 279.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.28,
      "end_seconds": 281.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.2,
      "end_seconds": 283.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.72,
      "end_seconds": 301.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Both tonsils are red and swollen, and there are white patches on the left one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.84,
      "end_seconds": 334.02,
      "duration_seconds": 27.18,
      "text": "Alright, all done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.02,
      "end_seconds": 338.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Okay, so thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.91,
      "end_seconds": 354.96,
      "duration_seconds": 16.05,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with a throat infection, either bacterial or viral at this stage. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a very sore throat for about a week, moderate, and no cough or runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.38,
      "end_seconds": 357.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.71,
      "end_seconds": 370.75,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "We should do a throat swab for sore throat. I'll start you on amoxicillin, 500 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. It's for throat infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.7,
      "end_seconds": 374.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.9,
      "end_seconds": 388.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.24,
      "text": "Finish the whole course of antibiotics even if you feel better after two days. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.68,
      "end_seconds": 406.7,
      "duration_seconds": 18.02,
      "text": "Right. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Keep an eye out, and if you can't swallow your saliva or you have trouble breathing, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.41,
      "end_seconds": 409.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.99,
      "end_seconds": 413.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Let's review you if it's not better in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.45,
      "end_seconds": 418.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.93,
      "end_seconds": 423.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.99,
      "end_seconds": 433.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "So, I take the amoxicillin, 500 milligrams, three times a day and come back if it's not better in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.56,
      "end_seconds": 440.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, all right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.46,
      "end_seconds": 443.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.93,
      "end_seconds": 445.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}